[node name="DawsonInteractable" parent="." unique_id=48577180 instance=ExtResource("16_5bu8y")]
position = Vector2(2736, 429)
dialogue = ["Huzzah!", "It is I! It is me!", "It's just the wizard you wanted to see!", "I am Dawson the Wise!", "And I am here to...", "Ah, I'm sorry. I believe we have met before, haven't we?", "Well, I hope I am not mistaken, but I am glad to see you again, my young apprentice.", "Hmm? someone behind us informed you that I was here?", "Ah, yes. I am not too surprised at that. I am quite the famous wizard!", "Ah, why I am here, you ask?", "Well, I have been looking for this rare crystal. Supposedly, it reflects anything and everything around it into itself.", "If you were to shift your gaze to it, you would see yourself in it!", "Yes, it sounds very intriguing, indeed. Hence why I am searching for it.", "But alas, with all the knowledge I bear, I am astounded by the fact that I had not known about this.", "Mirrorium has never been mentioned in any of the literature I have read.", "And you would be wise to know that I have read a library's full of books.", "Spell books. Story books. Non-fiction books. History books. Chapter books. Picture books. The list goes on for quite some time.", "And now that I mention it, I have reminded myself of this great tale I read.", "It was a tale of a tower, and the evil king who resided within.", "It was a tale of a faraway land, which had been plundered and terrorized by this tyrant.", "It was a tale of a feline adventurer, who hailed from a distant land and came to-", "Oh, I am terribly sorry! I was trailing off again with one of my boring stories!", "What's that, you say? Mirrorium is not a real crystal?", "Hmmm... mhm...", "Ah, so instead, it is a mirror you speak of.", "That must be the shiny painting I have in my tower.", "...mhm...?", "It's not a painting?", "Hmm...", "This vexes me very deeply.", "I must ponder this revelation posthaste.", "Well... How curious, is it, though?", "You, my young apprentice, have dispensed wisdom unto Dawson the Wise.", "And for that, I am grateful.", "But alas, I am once again thwarting your progress on your journey.", "I shall not stall you any longer. Please, continue with your quest.", "I hope to see you once more, my young apprentice!"]

